  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nBy using **BODMAS RULE,**\n\nOPTION 1) −, ×, +, =, ÷, +\n\n41 - 4 × 39 + 73 = **25 ÷ 4** + 30\n\n41 - **4 × 39** + 73 = 6.25 + 30\n\n**41** - 156 **+ 73** =** 6.25 + 30**\n\n41 - 229 = 36.25\n\n-188 is not equal to 36.25\n\n**OPTION 2) ×, +, −, =, ×, +**\n\n**41 × 4 **+ 39 - 73 = **25 × 4** + 30\n\n**164 + 39** - 73 = **100 + 30**\n\n**203 - 73** = 130\n\n130 = 130\n\n**Thus, LHS is equal to RHS**\n\nOPTION 3) ÷, +, =, ×, −, +\n\n**41 ÷ 4** + 39 = **73 × 25** - 4 + 30\n\n**10.25 + 39** = **1825** - 4 **+ 30**\n\n40.25 = **1825 - 34**\n\n40.25 is not equal to 1791\n\nOPTION 4) −, =, +, ×, −, ×\n\n41 - 4 = 39 + **73 × 25** - **4 × 30**\n\n37 = **39 + 1825** - 120\n\n37 = **1864 - 120**\n\nThus, LHS is not equal to RHS\n\nHence,** \"×, +, −, =, ×, +\" **is the correct answer.",
